<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Verificar Correo - {{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/resources/images/favicon.jpg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/styles/w3.css">
  <script defer src="/resources/scripts/alpinejs/dist/cdn.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-red: #dc2626;
      --brand-red-hover: #b91c1c;
      --brand-red-glow: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.35);
      --brand-black: #0d0d11;
      --brand-gray-dark: #18181b;
      --brand-gray-light: #f4f4f5;
    }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55)), url('/resources/images/background.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-color: var(--brand-black);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      padding: 16px;
      transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }
    body.w3-dark-mode {
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)), url('/resources/images/background.jpg');
    }
    .auth-card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: var(--w3-surface);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .card-header {
      background-color: var(--brand-black) !important;
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--brand-red);
      position: relative;
    }
    .brand-logo {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--brand-red-glow);
      border: 2px solid var(--brand-red);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }
    .brand-logo:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5);
    }
    .theme-toggle-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: #9ca3af;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .theme-toggle-btn:hover {
      color: var(--brand-red);
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15);
      color: var(--brand-red);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: var(--w3-surface-alt);
      color: var(--w3-text-color);
      border: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-red);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    body.w3-dark-mode .info-box {
      background-color: #27272a;
      color: #f4f4f5;
      border-color: #3f3f46;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-red);
    }
    .info-box p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: inherit;
    }
    .info-box strong {
      color: var(--brand-red);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .btn-submit {
      background-color: var(--brand-red);
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid var(--brand-red);
      padding: 11px 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px var(--brand-red-glow);
    }
    .btn-submit:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--brand-red-hover);
      border-color: var(--brand-red-hover);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.45);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .btn-submit:disabled {
      background-color: #52525b;
      border-color: #52525b;
      color: #a1a1aa;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .link-action {
      color: var(--brand-red);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, text-decoration 0.2s ease;
    }
    .link-action:hover {
      color: var(--brand-red-hover);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body
  x-data="{
    isDarkMode: window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches,
    submitting: false,
    init() {
      const mediaQuery = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)');
      this.isDarkMode = mediaQuery.matches;
      mediaQuery.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
        this.isDarkMode = event.matches;
      });
    }
  }"
  :class="{ 'w3-dark-mode': isDarkMode }"
>

  <main class="auth-card w3-animate-opacity">
    <!-- Encabezado con marca y temática Racing (Negro, Rojo y Gris) -->
    <header class="card-header w3-container w3-center w3-padding-24">
      <!-- Alternador de tema -->
      <button
        type="button"
        class="theme-toggle-btn"
        @click="isDarkMode = !isDarkMode"
        :title="isDarkMode ? 'Activar tema claro' : 'Activar tema oscuro'"
        aria-label="Alternar modo oscuro"
      >
        <!-- Sol (modo oscuro activo -> cambiar a claro) -->
        <svg x-show="isDarkMode" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
        </svg>
        <!-- Luna (modo claro activo -> cambiar a oscuro) -->
        <svg x-show="!isDarkMode" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.354 15.354A9 9 0 018.646 3.646 9.003 9.003 0 0012 21a9.003 9.003 0 008.354-5.646z" />
        </svg>
      </button>

      <!-- Banner / Mascota de Motorepuestos Robles -->
      <img
        src="/resources/images/banner.jpg"
        alt="{{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}"
        class="brand-logo w3-margin-bottom"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      >
      <h1 class="w3-large w3-bold" style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">{{ _ENV['APP_NAME'] }}</h1>
      <p class="w3-small" style="margin: 4px 0 0; color: #a1a1aa;">Verificación de cuenta</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Contenido del formulario -->
    <div class="w3-container" style="padding: 28px 28px 36px;">
      <div class="w3-center">
        <!-- Ícono de correo -->
        <div class="status-badge">
          <svg width="26" height="26" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;">
          Confirma tu correo electrónico
        </h2>
        
        <p class="w3-small" style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.6;">
          Para activar tu cuenta y acceder a las funciones del sistema, pulsa el botón a continuación para generar y enviar el enlace de verificación a tu correo electrónico.
        </p>

        <!-- Caja de ayuda con alto contraste -->
        <div class="info-box w3-left-align">
          <p>
            <strong>Paso siguiente:</strong> Al presionar el botón se enviará un mensaje a tu correo. Revisa tu bandeja de entrada (y la carpeta de correo no deseado o spam) para completar la activación.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Formulario para enviar el correo -->
      <form
        method="post"
        novalidate
        @submit="submitting = true"
      >
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="btn-submit"
          :disabled="submitting"
        >
          <span x-show="!submitting">Enviar correo de verificación</span>
          <span x-show="submitting" style="display: none;">Enviando correo...</span>
        </button>
      </form>

      <!-- Pie y navegación hacia cierre de sesión -->
      <footer class="w3-center" style="margin-top: 40px; padding: 24px 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--w3-border-light);">
        <p class="w3-small" style="margin: 0; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8;">
          ¿Deseas ingresar con otra cuenta?
          <a href="/salir" class="link-action" style="margin-left: 6px; display: inline-block;">
            Cerrar sesión
          </a>
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
